%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4fafe43b89343e3a7ba1235e8987c0f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Epilogue9_5_PostWallFlash
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Entries:
  - content: <i>Suddenly, Ari stops blinking. His posture slumps, then snaps rigid.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391639
  - content: Ari? You okay?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391640
    - rid: 314095765763391650
    - rid: 314095765763391651
  - content: <i>Without a word, Ari steps forward, walking directly towards the "wall."</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391641
  - content: "Okay, good. Let's mo\u2014"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391642
    - rid: 314095765763391643
  - content: <i>Behind him, three other scouts step forward. Then two more brush
      past Rocky, moving in perfect unison.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391644
  - content: "Hey! Watch it! What\u2019s the hurry?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391645
    - rid: 314095765763391646
  - content: <i>They don't react nor speak as they march into the darkness.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391647
  - content: What the hell? Stand down! That's an order!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391648
  - content: ...Their faces.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391652
    - rid: 314095765763391655
    - rid: 314095765763391653
    - rid: 314095765763391654
    - rid: 314095765763391656
  - content: "<i>Jay grabs Ari\u2019s arm. Ari turns. His eyes are vacant, glowing
      a faint, milky purple.</i>"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391657
  - content: ...My god.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391658
  - content: "It\u2019s... The Princess Frog."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391659
    - rid: 314095765763391660
  - content: Kid, what do you mean?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391662
    - rid: 314095765763391663
    - rid: 314095765763391675
    - rid: 314095765763391664
    - rid: 314095765763391665
  - content: "Look at Ari. And the others. They\u2019re all the ones you rescued,
      right? From the injections? "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391666
  - content: What!?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391667
  - content: The Frog controls Waste creatures. I didn't realize... that meant them
      too.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391668
    - rid: 314095765763391669
  - content: <i>Ari breaks free from Jay's hold, and continues marching up the tunnels.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391670
  - content: "Then we\u2019ve got to move. Who knows what that Frog will do to them
      once they arrive!"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391671
  - content: "Everyone on me! Let\u2019s get our people back!"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391672
    - rid: 314095765763391673
    - rid: 314095765763391674
